Key Business Rules:
- Lab work always categorized separately from supplies
- Equipment threshold set at $500 unless vendor override
- Supplies sub-categorized by department (hygiene, clinical, etc)
- Patient-specific items routed to lab expenses
- Multi-office practices get location-specific categories

The engine implements dental industry-specific categorization with sophisticated vendor handling, terminology matching, and practice-level customization.

